{"type":"standard","title":"Lloyd Smucker","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lloyd Smucker</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q6662742","titles":{"canonical":"Lloyd_Smucker","normalized":"Lloyd Smucker","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Lloyd Smucker</span></span>"},"pageid":22363537,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/48/Lloyd_Smucker_Official_Congressional_Photo.jpg/330px-Lloyd_Smucker_Official_Congressional_Photo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/48/Lloyd_Smucker_Official_Congressional_Photo.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1364147186","tid":"f456b5c1-7fbf-11f1-b20f-37377685bd3d","timestamp":"2026-07-14T20:09:44Z","description":"American politician (born 1964)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lloyd_Smucker","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lloyd_Smucker?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lloyd_Smucker?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lloyd_Smucker"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lloyd_Smucker","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Lloyd_Smucker","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lloyd_Smucker?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Lloyd_Smucker"}},"extract":"Lloyd Kenneth Smucker is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative from Pennsylvania's 11th congressional district, which includes Lancaster County and most of southern York County. He is a member of the Republican Party and represented the 16th district until the Supreme Court of Pennsylvania redrew it in 2018. He was a member of the Pennsylvania State Senate for the 13th district from 2009 to 2016.","extract_html":"<p><b>Lloyd Kenneth Smucker</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative from Pennsylvania's 11th congressional district, which includes Lancaster County and most of southern York County. He is a member of the Republican Party and represented the 16th district until the Supreme Court of Pennsylvania redrew it in 2018. He was a member of the Pennsylvania State Senate for the 13th district from 2009 to 2016.</p>"}